NNAAMMEE
       pbmto10x - convert a PBM image into Gemini 10X printer graphics


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppbbmmttoo1100xx [--hh] [_p_b_m_f_i_l_e]


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmttoo1100xx  reads  a PBM image as input and produces a file of Gemini 10X
       printer graphics as output.  The 10x's printer codes are alleged to  be
       similar to the Epson codes.

       Note that there is no 10xtopbm tool - this transformation is one way.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In  addition  to  the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ppbbmmttoo1100xx  recognizes  the
       following command line option:



       --hh

              The  resolution  is  normally 60H by 72V.  If you specify the --hh
              option, resolution is 120H by 144V.  You may find it  useful  to
              rotate landscape images before printing.




